# .aai/system/COPILOT_SHIM_SHIPPED.list — one lowercase sha256 per line: the normalized
# hash N(text) of every version of .github/copilot-instructions.md this repository has shipped
# (N deletes every CR, then the trailing LF characters). aai-sync (bash and PowerShell) reads it
# to tell an unmodified older shim from a real project override. Seeded from the git history of
# the shim; `node .aai/scripts/sync-harness-skills.mjs --write` appends the rendered version, and
# --check reports a rendered hash that is not recorded here. Format and caveats:
# .aai/scripts/lib/harness-shims.mjs.
